  "body": "## Why\nThe previous backlog fix removed future-step reservations completely. That makes the backend report raw remaining daily action quota as the number of new conversations, which is not the intended model.\n\nThe intended model is reservation-based:\n- dailyNegotiationBudget is the daily pool of price actions\n- a new conversation may start only when the pool can cover its entire configured negotiation ladder\n- already-sent actions count against today's quota\n- every active NEGOTIATING/ACTION_REQUIRED conversation reserves only its still-unsent steps\n- if a conversation finishes early, its unused reservation is released immediately\n- at midnight the actual-used counter resets for the new Warsaw day, but still-active conversations continue reserving their remaining future steps\n\nExample with 25 daily actions and 5 configured steps:\n- fresh day: 5 new full conversations fit\n- five conversations that all finish after step 3 on the same day used 15 actions, so 10 actions remain and 2 more full conversations fit\n- new day with three conversations still active at currentStep=3: they reserve 3*2=6 actions; 19 remain, so floor(19/5)=3 new conversations fit\n\n## Changes\n- restores reservation-aware NegotiationPlanner and removes the previous off-by-one behavior\n- currentStep means the last already-sent step, so an active step-3 conversation in a 5-step ladder reserves exactly 2 future actions, not 3\n- counts both NEGOTIATING and ACTION_REQUIRED as active reservations\n- missing/invalid currentStep fails safe by reserving the full ladder\n- NegotiationCapacityService combines today's actual remaining quota with active future-step reservations and divides the remainder by the full ladder size\n- frontend budget copy now explains the reservation and midnight behavior\n\n## Tests\nCovers:\n- fresh 25/5 => 5 new conversations\n- five step-1 active conversations => 0 more starts\n- five conversations finished after three same-day steps => 2 additional starts\n- midnight with three active step-3 conversations => 3 new starts\n- NEGOTIATING + ACTION_REQUIRED reservations\n- missing currentStep fail-safe behavior\n- used-today + reserved-future arithmetic\n- exhausted quota and missing-step fail-closed behavior\n",
